{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Curated local threat feed of known-bad indicators. A match yields an instant, high-confidence malicious verdict without needing the scraper, AI or an external reputation call. This is a SEED feed of illustrative/known-abused indicators plus reusable patterns; for production it should be refreshed from live feeds (see backend/data/README or the reputation module docstring). Matches are keyed on registrable domain (eTLD+1) for 'domains', full host for 'hosts', and regex for 'patterns'.",
